ts mest innflytelsesrike entreprenører, eiendomsutvik.","fact_ids":"d0b91f4edae0b5b6b1243384"},{"position":3,"kind":"financials","text":"Latest filed accounts (2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, company accounts): revenue NOK 50.1 m, operating result NOK 2.5 m, net result NOK 1.8 m, total assets NOK 24.7 m, equity NOK 7.5 m. The period closed with a profit.","fact_ids":"1a8ca6a6c2a39c23ac5e1925|6d39e3c34455a7bf8fed1001|ccc2952897807b6686638043|5ca37eab990ce0ae1840893b|d91d1e37ef4c140d6f2fe9a9"},{"position":4,"kind":"financial_change","text":"Change from 2024 to 2025: revenue went from NOK 56.9 m to NOK 50.1 m (-12%); net result went from NOK 4.1 m to NOK 1.8 m (-55%); equity went from NOK 7.1 m to NOK 7.5 m (+5%).","fact_ids":"1a8ca6a6c2a39c23ac5e1925|97002c9e99460e48ad63b2d2|ccc2952897807b6686638043|4d08f9aeda6eddac429eb2b3|d91d1e37ef4c140d6f2fe9a9|bb2bfa904a8979ad33229fd2"},{"position":5,"kind":"financial_health","text":"Financial position in 2025: operating margin 4.9%; equity ratio 30.4%. Calculated from the filed figures above.","fact_ids":"1a8ca6a6c2a39c23ac5e1925|6d39e3c34455a7bf8fed1001|d91d1e37ef4c140d6f2fe9a9|5ca37eab990ce0ae1840893b"},{"position":6,"kind":"size","text":"Registered employees: 42.","fact_ids":"7a5b58a3952d20b94d0b66a9"},{"position":7,"kind":"leadership","text":"Leadership in the official register: Eirik Røhmesmo (managing director); Haakon Bruusgaard Irgens (chair of the board); Ola Østtveit Agledahl (board member); SKI REVISJON AS (auditor); plus 1 further role.","fact_ids":"02a9b4b5e99a0b61a9a013b6|6d3da65c1b124d9832f686ec|88df341d30d12f115ef29b9a|9c63ef9922d30c3f21d6ef1d"},{"position":8,"kind":"footprint","text":"1 registered workplace in Oslo.","fact_ids":"910ed0677bd6fc334ef1dccf"},{"position":9,"kind":"footprint","text":"Official website https://www.hoyden.no (identity check: full name domain and registered operating head); company-linked profiles on facebook, instagram, linkedin, vimeo.","fact_ids":"7a127396b19b62e7c1613970|59cf2aecf973c31acc